## Weekly Product Pulse — Week of October 17, 2026

### Summary
Customer feedback across recent reviews reveals severe friction regarding redemption fees, with exit load confusion dominating over 90% of critical reviews. While app navigation and fund discovery are appreciated, unexpected liquidation deductions are directly driving 1-star ratings and support tickets.

### Top Themes
- Exit Load Misunderstanding: 49 mentions (avg 2.4★). Users experience unexpected deductions upon redemption without prior disclosure.
- SIP Installment Calculation Confusion: 14 mentions (avg 2.8★). Widespread confusion that SIPs follow a single folio period rather than per-installment clocks.
- Returns Discrepancy & Net Payout: 10 mentions (avg 2.2★). Negative reviews cite gaps between displayed returns/XIRR and actual net proceeds.

### Supporting User Quotes
- "I was charged exit load on a fund I held for over a year. Customer support says it's because I did SIP and each installment has its own 1-year period. This is EXTREMELY misleading. The app should explain this clearly." — Neha P (1/5)
