### Key Observation
The primary driver of user dissatisfaction is silent redemption execution. Users are only notified of exit load deductions after confirming redemption, creating perceptions of misleading 'zero commission' marketing.

### Action Ideas
- Deploy a Pre-Redemption Breakdown modal displaying gross amount, exit load, GST, and net payout prior to confirmation.
- Add a visual SIP Maturity Tracker in the portfolio dashboard displaying FIFO status for each monthly installment.
- Update fund detail cards with high-visibility callouts specifying exit load duration and applicable tiers.

